# This repo tracks only the app folders -- internal planning docs (PRD, SPEC,
# idea refinement, pitch deck, hackathon brief, technical architecture) stay
# local and out of the public GitHub repo.
#
# app/       -- frozen hackathon demo build
# app_prod/  -- the fuller build in progress
*
!.gitignore
!README.md
!app/
!app/**
!app_prod/
!app_prod/**
app/appinfo.md
app_prod/appinfo.md
node_modules/
dist/
